9)KEYBOARD ACTIVITY

Create a variable [userText] with datatype as [String]
inputDialog box (activity)
  InputLabel  :  “Enter your message:”
  Value entered  :  userText
Open notepad
Use application/browser(activity)
    Indicate on screen  (notepad)
  In Do,
              Type Into (activity)
                  Indicate on screen  (notepad)
             Type this  =  userText
